# Tester telemetry (DATA-06). This repo is public. Returned logs are named after the player and,
# since the collector started including Player.log, carry GPU/CPU/OS/resolution and any path the
# %USERPROFILE% redaction missed. Keep them outside the repo -- these rules are only the backstop.
playtest-logs/
**/playtest-logs/
/playtest-logs/**/*.jsonl
/playtest-summary.md
/summary.md
ClickDungeon-playtest-logs.zip

